# TechNova E-Commerce – Product Knowledge Base

## Company Information
TechNova is an online electronics store founded in 2021. Its headquarters is located in Bangalore, India. The company sells smartphones, laptops, accessories, and smart home devices.

Customer support is available Monday to Saturday, from 9 AM to 6 PM.

