## Shipping Policy
- Standard delivery takes 4–7 business days.
- Express delivery takes 1–2 business days.
- Free shipping is available on orders above ₹999.
- Orders below ₹999 have a shipping charge of ₹49.
- Currently, delivery is available across India.

## Return and Refund Policy
- Customers can return eligible products within 7 days of delivery.
- Products must be unused and returned with original packaging.
- Refund processing takes 5–7 business days after return approval.
- Products damaged due to customer misuse are not eligible for returns.

## Payment Methods
TechNova accepts:
- UPI
- Credit Cards
- Debit Cards
- Net Banking
- Cash on Delivery (COD)

## Order Cancellation
- Customers can cancel orders before shipment.
- Orders that have already been shipped cannot be cancelled.
- Refunds for prepaid cancelled orders are processed within 5–7 business days.

## Loyalty Program
- Customers earn 2 reward points for every ₹100 spent.
- Every 100 reward points are equivalent to ₹10.
- Reward points expire after 12 months.
- Reward points cannot be transferred between accounts.